Hi Sam,

I asked Hannah , our park specialist, about it.  Turns out the cash drawer =
does not always work.  A few months ago, it kicked open every time, but we =
were having issues with the printer.  We now no longer have issues with the=
 printer, but now have issues with the cash drawer not kicking open after e=
ach transaction.   I would still watch your fingers as it may decide to wor=
k some days.

[cid:image001.jpg@01DB77DA.C3BEF850]Logan Bliss | Volunteer Services Lead/R=
anger 1
