Subject: Cash Transactions

Hey Logan,

Just want to flag a pattern I'm seeing...

The last two times I've had a cash transaction and needed to give change, t=
he register hasn't kicked out on its own. Of course not an issue, just seem=
s like wrong behavior.

I don't think I'm doing anything wrong because the orders are closed and I'=
m inputting the amount they give me and it does show change due. Here's the=
 most recent one.

Sam

